# Unit14
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit14核心词汇

rank/ræŋk/等级；排名/She ranks first in her class.
ratio/ˈreɪʃioʊ/比率/The ratio of boys to girls is 3 to 2.
rational/ˈræʃənl/理性的/We need a rational approach to the problem.
raw/rɔː/生的；原始的/The factory needs raw materials for production.
react/riˈækt/反应/How did she react to the news?
realm/relm/领域/He made great contributions to the realm of science.
reasonable/ˈriːznəbl/合理的/This is a reasonable request.
rebel/ˈrebl/反叛/The people rebelled against the tyrant.
recall/rɪˈkɔːl/回忆；召回/I can't recall his name.
recognition/ˌrekəɡˈnɪʃn/认可/She received recognition for her work.
recommend/ˌrekəˈmend/推荐/I recommend this book to everyone.
recover/rɪˈkʌvər/恢复/She recovered quickly from the illness.
recreation/ˌrekriˈeɪʃn/娱乐/Parks are important for recreation.
recruit/rɪˈkruːt/招聘/The company is recruiting new staff.
reduce/rɪˈduːs/减少/We need to reduce our expenses.
refer/rɪˈfɜːr/参考/Please refer to the handbook for details.
reflect/rɪˈflekt/反映；反思/The results reflect the quality of teaching.
reform/rɪˈfɔːrm/改革/The government introduced economic reforms.
refugee/ˌrefjuˈdʒiː/难民/The camp provides shelter for refugees.
regime/reɪˈʒiːm/政权/The regime was overthrown by the people.
register/ˈredʒɪstər/注册/You need to register for the course.
regulate/ˈreɡjuleɪt/管理；调节/The government regulates the banking industry.
reinforce/ˌriːɪnˈfɔːrs/加强/The evidence reinforces his argument.
reject/rɪˈdʒekt/拒绝/She rejected his proposal.
relate/rɪˈleɪt/联系/How does this relate to the topic?
relevant/ˈreləvənt/相关的/Please provide relevant documents.
reliable/rɪˈlaɪəbl/可靠的/He is a reliable person.
relieve/rɪˈliːv/缓解/The medicine relieved the pain.
reluctant/rɪˈlʌktənt/不情愿的/She was reluctant to accept the offer.
rely/rɪˈlaɪ/依赖/You can rely on me for help.
remain/rɪˈmeɪn/保持/She remained calm during the emergency.
remark/rɪˈmɑːrk/评论/He made a remark about the weather.
remarkable/rɪˈmɑːrkəbl/显著的/She has made remarkable progress.
remedy/ˈremədi/补救措施/There is no easy remedy for this problem.
remote/rɪˈmoʊt/遥远的/The village is in a remote area.
remove/rɪˈmuːv/移除/Please remove your shoes before entering.
render/ˈrendər/使成为/The accident rendered him unconscious.
renew/rɪˈnuː/更新/She renewed her passport last month.
replace/rɪˈpleɪs/取代/Nothing can replace a mother's love.
represent/ˌreprɪˈzent/代表/She represents the company at international events.
reproduce/ˌriːprəˈduːs/复制；繁殖/The experiment is difficult to reproduce.
reputation/ˌrepjuˈteɪʃn/声誉/He has a good reputation in the community.
request/rɪˈkwest/请求/She made a request for more time.
require/rɪˈkwaɪər/要求/The job requires a lot of patience.
rescue/ˈreskjuː/营救/The firefighters rescued the child from the fire.
resemble/rɪˈzembl/类似/She resembles her mother in many ways.
reserve/rɪˈzɜːrv/保留；预订/I'd like to reserve a table for two.
resign/rɪˈzaɪn/辞职/He resigned from his position last month.
resist/rɪˈzɪst/抵抗/She couldn't resist the temptation.
resolve/rɪˈzɑːlv/解决/We must resolve this conflict peacefully.
